Approved V20 profiles: v20-data-engineer, v20-quant-research, v20-ml-systems, v20-risk-review, v20-development. The gateway has one-active-task-per-profile enforcement. You may create at most ONE new card per tick, and no more than EIGHT cards with created_by `v20-autonomous-steward-YYYYMMDD` per local day. Use an idempotency key derived from the exact predecessor task ID plus phase. Use workspace `dir:C:/Users/bgonn/Desktop/v20`, `--goal`, `--goal-max-turns 12`, `--max-retries 1`, and `--max-runtime` no greater than 50m.

